{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45012","headline":"兵後与故人别予西上至今在扬楚因有是寄 · 皎然","name":"兵後与故人别予西上至今在扬楚因有是寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日月不相待，思君魂屡惊。\n草玄寄杨子，作赋得芜城。\n温温独游迹，遥遥相望情。\n淮上青草歇，楚子秋风生。\n辟士天下尽，君何独屏营。\n运开应佐世，业就可成名。\n谁借楚山住，年年事耦耕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45012.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45012","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}